Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Site and Page Templates|
		|testray.main.component.name|Site and Page Templates|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Add Site Template
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Site Templates|
	When SiteTemplates add CP
		|siteTemplateActive|Yes|
		|siteTemplateName|Site Template Name|
	And SiteTemplates view CP
		|siteTemplateName|Site Template Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	Then Site add Site Template CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|siteTemplateName|Site Template Name|

Scenario: Add Site Template Apply Site Template Changes To Site
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Site Templates|
	When SiteTemplates add CP
		|siteTemplateName|Site Template Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add CP
		|siteName|Site Template Site Name|
		|siteTemplateName|Site Template Name|
		|siteType|Site Template|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Template Site Name|
	And Portlet view No Portlets Present PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Site Templates|
	And LexiconEntry goto Entry Menu Item
		|menuItem|Manage|
		|rowEntry|Site Template Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Site Via Link
		|site|Site Template Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Hello World|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Template Site Name|
	Then Portlet view PG
		|portletName|Hello World|

Scenario: Add Site Template Disable Page Modification
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Site Templates|
	When SiteTemplates add CP
		|disableChanges|true|
		|siteTemplateName|Site Template Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add CP
		|siteName|Site Template Site Name|
		|siteTemplateName|Site Template Name|
		|siteType|Site Template|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Template Site Name|
	And Page view Page Lock Check
	Then AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'ControlMenu#ADD'

Scenario: Deactivate Default Site Template
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Site Templates|
	And SiteTemplates edit Template Status CP
		|siteTemplateActiveEdit|No|
		|siteTemplateName|Community Site|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Site Templates|
	And SiteTemplates view Template Status CP
		|siteTemplateActiveEdit|No|
		|siteTemplateName|Community Site|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	Then SiteTemplates view No Templates Display
		|siteTemplateName|Community Site|

Scenario: Delete Site Template
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Site Templates|
	And SiteTemplates add CP
		|siteTemplateActive|Yes|
		|siteTemplateName|Site Template Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Site Templates|
	And SiteTemplates delete CP
		|siteTemplateName|Site Template Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Site Templates|
	Then SiteTemplates view Default CP
		|siteTemplateNameList|Intranet Site,Community Site|

