Scenario: Localize Default Site Templates
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Site Templates|
	When SiteTemplates view Default CP
		|siteTemplateNameList|Community Site,Intranet Site|
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|Account Settings|
	And MyAccount change User Language
		|languageName|español (España)|
		|saveButton|Save|
		|successMessage|Su petición ha terminado con éxito.|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Localized Control Panel
		|category|Sitios web|
		|portlet|Plantillas de sitio web|
		|tab|Panel de control|
	And SiteTemplates view Default Data Localized CP
		|siteTemplateDescriptionList|Sitio con foro y wiki,Sitio con documentos y noticias|
		|siteTemplateNameList|Sitio de la Comunidad,Sitio de intranet|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Localized User My Account
		|category|Mi cuenta|
		|portlet|Mi cuenta|
	And MyAccount change User Language
		|languageName|English (United States)|
		|saveButton|Guardar|
		|successMessage|Your request completed successfully.|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Site Templates|
	Then SiteTemplates view Default CP
		|siteTemplateNameList|Community Site,Intranet Site|

Scenario: Only Site Admin Can Modify Page Associated With Site Template
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Site Templates|
	When SiteTemplates add CP
		|siteTemplateName|Site Template Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add CP
		|siteName|Site Template Site Name|
		|siteTemplateName|Site Template Name|
		|siteType|Site Template|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Template Site Name|
	And AssertElementPresent at locator 'ControlMenu#ADD'
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Template Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Members
		|portlet|Site Memberships|
	And Site assign User As Member CP
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And User logout User PG
	And User login User PG
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Template Site Name|
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'ControlMenu#ADD'
	And User logout User PG
	Then User login User PG

Scenario: Reset Page Changes
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	When Site add Community CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet drag And Drop Portlet To Column PG
		|columnNumberFrom|2|
		|columnNumberTo|1|
		|portletName|User Statistics|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And SiteTemplates reset Page Changes
		|columnNumberTo|1|
		|portletName|User Statistics|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then SiteTemplates view Reset Page Changes
		|columnNumberFrom|2|
		|portletName|User Statistics|